# Each flag event once; the map state as it changes. The guest's snapshot waits for its map
# state part (the lost fog event is the flag board's to bring).
wlog host start epoch 5a1900000001
wlog host appended seq 1 reset every map
wlog host appended seq 2 flag 12414700 on
wlog host appended seq 3 flag 12417830 on
wlog host appended seq 4 map state of 0x18010000
wlog host appended seq 5 map flag 12410003 on
wlog host appended seq 6 map flag 12410900 on
wlog host appended seq 7 map flag 12410003 off
wlog member follows epoch 5a1900000001
wlog member applied seq 1 reset every map
wlog member gap: has seq 1, host at 3
wlog member gap: has seq 1, host at 3
wlog member gap: has seq 1, host at 3
wlog member snapshot to seq 3
wlog member shown on 0x0: 0 characters
wlog member map state of 0x0
wlog member applied seq 4 map state of 0x18010000
wlog member applied seq 5 map flag 12410003 on
wlog member applied seq 6 map flag 12410900 on
